# shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4 rules

## Adding components

- Add primitives with the CLI, never by hand:
  ```bash
  pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component>
  ```
- Registry style is `radix-nova`, base color `neutral`, CSS variables on.
  This is pinned in `components.json` — do not change it.
- Generated primitives live in `src/components/ui/` and are imported as
  `@/components/ui/*`.

## Where components go

- `components/ui/*` — generated primitives. Do NOT edit these to restyle the app.
- `shared/ui/*` — project-wide compositions of primitives.
- `pages/*/ui/*` — compositions used by a single page.

## Styling

- Tailwind v4 is CSS-first: theme, tokens, and utilities live in `src/index.css`
  via `@theme` / `@layer`. There is no `tailwind.config.js`.
- Colors are OKLCH. Use semantic tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`,
  `border-border`) — never raw hex.
- Theme through the `:root` / `.dark` variables in `index.css`. `--accent-hue`
  drives every accent; `--neutral-hue` drives paper surfaces and ink.
- Glass surfaces: `.glass-subtle`, `.glass`, `.glass-strong`. Never stack more
  than two glass layers.
- Merge class names with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Brand icons (GitHub, X, LinkedIn) come from `@/shared/ui/brandIcons` —
  `lucide-react` v1 dropped brand marks. All other icons come from `lucide-react`.
